{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは田村真佑です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日1月12日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お誕生日を迎えました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わーい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "27歳になりましたよ\nすっかり大人ですね☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山のお祝いの言葉を貰って\nもうすでに幸せでいっぱいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色々な変化があるなかで変わらないのは\n私を好きでいてくれる君がいてくれて\nそんな君に私も愛を届け続けるということ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はこの文章を読んでくれてる君のことが\nだいすきだよ☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "27歳の田村真佑はきっと\n日々の些細な出来事も\n自分の成長につなげれる\nそんな人になってると思いますよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうだといいなの願いを込めて\nここに書いておきますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobvjjhWc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "27歳も幸せが溢れる年になりますように"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}